# CSV Spreadsheet Pro - Project Walkthrough

## Overview

Created a beautiful, modern web application that transforms CSV files into interactive, editable spreadsheets. The application features a premium dark theme, smooth animations, and comprehensive data manipulation capabilities.

## Project Structure

The project is located at: `C:\Users\samsung\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\csv-spreadsheet-converter\`

```
csv-spreadsheet-converter/
├── index.html          # Main application structure
├── style.css          # Premium dark theme styling
├── script.js          # Application logic and functionality
├── sample-data.csv    # Sample employee data for testing
└── README.md          # Comprehensive documentation
```

## Features Implemented

### 🎨 Premium UI Design

- **Dark Theme**: Sleek dark interface with vibrant purple/blue accents
- **Glassmorphism Effects**: Modern card designs with subtle gradients
- **Smooth Animations**: Fade-in effects, hover states, and transitions
- **Responsive Layout**: Works perfectly on desktop and mobile devices
- **Google Fonts Integration**: Inter font family for modern typography

### 📤 File Upload System

- **Drag & Drop**: Intuitive drag-and-drop area for CSV files
- **Click to Browse**: Traditional file selection option
- **Visual Feedback**: Hover effects and color changes during drag operations
- **File Validation**: Ensures only CSV files are accepted

### 📊 CSV Parser

- **Robust Parsing**: Handles complex CSV formats
- **Quoted Values**: Supports values with commas inside quotes
- **Escaped Quotes**: Properly handles `""` escape sequences
- **Auto Header Detection**: Automatically identifies header row
- **Error Handling**: Graceful handling of malformed data

### 📋 Interactive Spreadsheet

- **Sticky Headers**: Column headers stay visible while scrolling
- **Alternating Rows**: Enhanced readability with striped rows
- **Hover Effects**: Smooth highlighting on cell and row hover
- **Statistics Bar**: Real-time display of row count, column count, and filename
- **Scrollable Container**: Handles large datasets efficiently

### ✏️ Cell Editing

- **Modal Editor**: Clean modal interface for editing cell values
- **Click to Edit**: Simply click any cell to edit its content
- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: 
  - `Ctrl+Enter` to save
  - `Escape` to cancel
- **Visual Feedback**: Highlighted cells and smooth modal animations

### 🔢 Column Sorting

- **Click to Sort**: Click column headers to sort
- **Toggle Direction**: Click again to reverse sort order
- **Smart Detection**: Automatically detects numbers vs. text
- **Visual Indicators**: Arrow icons show current sort state (↑/↓)
- **Stable Sorting**: Maintains data integrity during sort operations

### 🔍 Search & Filter

- **Real-time Search**: Instant filtering as you type
- **Multi-column**: Searches across all columns simultaneously
- **Case Insensitive**: User-friendly search matching
- **Clear Results**: Easy to clear and view all data again

### 💾 Export Options

- **CSV Export**: Download modified data as CSV
- **JSON Export**: Export data in JSON format
- **Preserved Edits**: All changes are included in exports
- **Proper Escaping**: CSV values are properly quoted when needed
- **Auto Filename**: Smart filename generation based on source file

