## Technical Highlights

### Performance
- **Pure JavaScript**: No framework overhead, fast load times
- **Efficient Rendering**: Smart DOM manipulation for smooth scrolling
- **Optimized Search**: Real-time filtering without lag
- **Memory Efficient**: Handles large CSV files smoothly

### Code Quality
- **Modular Design**: Clean separation of concerns
- **Event-driven**: Proper event listener management
- **Error Handling**: Graceful handling of edge cases
- **Maintainable**: Well-commented and organized code

